Z||000000||DXR_DAD||12-14-1999||07:47 PM||||Yep, the tach on my 87 sometimes moves like a clock!!! and then other times it just drops off to 0 . What do I do to check it? Or do I just replace it? But mostof the time it works fine.<P>Thanks||||reg||9
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||12-14-1999||08:40 PM||||I don't think it's the tach itself. The tach is nothing more than two coils and if it's broken it either shows 0, or it will bury the needle. You could try changing the tachfilter, or simply re-seat the tachometer and/or the wires to the dash.||||reg||1
