Z||000003||DXR_DAD||12-14-1999||10:50 PM||||I just started the car, haven't started it for a week. when I got in the tach was at about 1500 I didn't even have the key in???<BR>When I turned the key to the on position it droped to 0. I did this three times, all the same. I started it and it jumped 2000 I turned it off and the tach stayed at 2000. turn to on position it drops to 0 .<BR>what ever it reads while running it stays there when I turn the key off. It idles at 900-1000.<P>I need HELP!! What is it?||||reg||1
